Tark: the suggestions popup is the site's suggestion box (spec 6.1): an 18 DIP
frame radius (the omnibox expanded-radius token, between Medium 16 and Large
24), and rows that are 12px rounded rects inset 6px from the sides with the
indigo wash and no blue focus bar. Chromium 155 renders suggestions as WebUI
(kWebUIOmniboxPopup), so the rows are styled in the shared searchbox CSS.

